<title>GREECE: U.S. EMBASSY OFFICIAL DENIES POLL ON GREEK ELECTIONS.</title>
<headline>U.S. EMBASSY OFFICIAL DENIES POLL ON GREEK ELECTIONS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>An official at the U.S. embassy in Athens denied market rumours of a poll on the outcome of Greek elections to be held on September 22.</p>
<p>&quot;The U.S embassy has conducted no poll on these elections,&quot; said an official at the U.S embassy in Athens.</p>
<p>Western diplomatic sources said that the race was too close to call. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
